The files in this directory are prebuilt, minified distributions of xterm.js
(@xterm/xterm 5.5.0 and @xterm/addon-fit 0.10.0). They are third-party software,
not ClusterSpace code, and are covered by the MIT licence below rather than by
ClusterSpace's own licence.

Upstream: https://github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js

Minification stripped the licence banner from xterm.js and addon-fit.js; this file
supplies the notice their licence requires to accompany any redistribution.

